  151|       |            // Type is `ValueCommit^{Sapling}.Output`, i.e. J
  152|       |            // https://zips.z.cash/protocol/protocol.pdf#abstractcommit
  153|       |            // See [`sapling_crypto::value::ValueCommitment::zcash_deserialize`].
